==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level can be treated like a tougher version of [[Melancholy Damp]]. If you have unlocked [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]], you can use her to quickly defeat St. Pigge the 2nd. If you have [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat/Paris Cat]], you can use her to make quick work of St. Pigge the 2nd as well.

